WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.832
Create your buyer account. Open FabricTrad and choose Create account. Choose Buy

00:00:04.832 --> 00:00:09.664
for myself for personal purchases, or Buy for my shop for a

00:00:09.664 --> 00:00:14.496
business. Personal buyers do not need business documents. Shop buyers enter their

00:00:14.496 --> 00:00:19.328
business details and complete the checks shown. Keep your registered email and

00:00:19.328 --> 00:00:24.160
contact number up to date.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:29.397
Sign in and choose a language. Sign in using your registered email

00:00:29.397 --> 00:00:33.634
and password. If you forget your password, use the recovery option on

00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:37.870
the sign-in page. The language control changes the website text. On How

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:42.107
to Use, choose Buyer, then English, Hindi or Gujarati for the narrated

00:00:42.107 --> 00:00:46.344
guide. You can pause, seek or turn on captions.

00:00:47.344 --> 00:00:51.616
Find and inspect fabric. After signing in, open Marketplace. Search by product

00:00:51.616 --> 00:00:55.888
or seller, and use categories and filters to narrow the choices. Open

00:00:55.888 --> 00:01:00.160
a product to inspect its photographs, colour variants, price, unit, available stock

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:04.432
and minimum quantity. Check the seller and dispatch details before choosing the

00:01:04.432 --> 00:01:08.704
exact variant you want.

00:01:09.704 --> 00:01:14.277
Explore Virtual Drape. On supported products, open Virtual Drape. Choose the exact

00:01:14.277 --> 00:01:18.850
colour, then an AI model or your own photograph. Give photo consent

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:23.422
before uploading a personal image. Generated previews are illustrative and do not

00:01:23.422 --> 00:01:27.995
guarantee fit or exact colour. Generation requires available service credits. A service-unavailable

00:01:27.995 --> 00:01:32.568
message means a preview has not been generated.

00:01:33.568 --> 00:01:37.539
Place the order and pay. Choose the quantity, add the product to

00:01:37.539 --> 00:01:41.509
your cart and review the delivery details. Submit the order request. When

00:01:41.509 --> 00:01:45.480
the seller accepts and payment becomes available, use FabricTrad's Razorpay checkout. A

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:49.451
seller must have an approved payout bank before checkout opens. Pay the

00:01:49.451 --> 00:01:53.421
amount shown once, and wait for payment confirmation before retrying a pending

00:01:53.421 --> 00:01:57.392
transaction.

00:01:58.392 --> 00:02:02.571
Track delivery and open invoices. Open your buyer dashboard and choose Orders

00:02:02.571 --> 00:02:06.750
or Tracking. Each shipment shows the carrier selected for that order, its

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:10.930
AWB number and the tracking link. Different orders may use different carriers.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:15.109
Open the order's invoice or receipt when available. Keep your delivery address

00:02:15.109 --> 00:02:19.288
and email correct so documents and updates reach the right place.

00:02:20.288 --> 00:02:24.950
Get help with an order. Use the website's order conversation, support or

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:29.613
dispute tools if something needs attention. Keep the order reference and relevant

00:02:29.613 --> 00:02:34.275
photos together. Check the return and exchange policy for the product before

00:02:34.275 --> 00:02:38.938
buying. Buyer WhatsApp shopping is currently unavailable; use the website for purchases

00:02:38.938 --> 00:02:43.600
and order support. You are ready to explore FabricTrad.
